	(text "ROM starts at C8000 on the PC\nand C000 on the CoCo. Address\nlines A4, A5, and A6 are inverted\nbetween the CoCo and the PC card,\nmaking the ROM scrambled. You can\nscramble/descramble the ROM easily\n  for(i=0;i<ROM_SIZE;i++)   \n    out[i^0x70] = in[i];\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
